<title>USA: Franklin Quest sees $3.5 mln Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>Franklin Quest sees $3.5 mln Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Quest Co said Thursday it expects to post fourth-quarter earnings of between $0.13 and $0.15 a share, due in part to a $3.5 million one-time charge due to inventory and customer allowances.</p>
<p>The company expects fourth quarter revenues to be about $74 million, up about three percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>Franklin Quest said it earned $0.35 a share in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
</text>
